  "title": "Gluten-Free Zucchini Bread",
  "description": "This gluten-free zucchini bread is moist, tender, and a delicious way to use fresh zucchini. Drizzle a simple lemon glaze on top for a sweet treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Gluten Free Cook"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:55:32-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-08-04T11:27:44-04:00",
